          "text": "Témoignages: [MER] MINORQUE (ES.PM) 02.03.2018",
          "text_sha256": "bf87e42a44ab841b3ecb7cd3a09f89364d571653e92d6a478982a7ada34b2531"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
